[00:05.07]Two sides to a story but they never tell my side
{"故事总有双面 却无人讲述我的立场"}
[00:08.14]Never been the kinda guy to stay inside the guidelines
{"从来不是循规蹈矩的乖顺模样"}
[00:10.93]I know I'm the bad guy, I don't gotta ask why
{"我自知是反派角色 无需追问原因"}
[00:13.81]If you try to step to me, it'll be the last time
{"若你胆敢挑衅 那将是最后光阴"}
[00:16.48]
[00:17.05]I got dirt on my name, 6 feet in the ground
{"声名蒙尘 如深埋六尺之下"}
[00:19.73]I got people in my past try bringing me down
{"过往之人 妄图将我拽落悬崖"}
[00:22.50]Say I'm losing my mind, I don't wanna be found
{"说我疯癫失常 宁愿隐匿无痕"}
[00:25.36]Grew up in the shadow but I know they watching me now
{"阴影中成长 却知此刻众目灼人"}
[00:28.44]Paranoia, on-the-go, I'm moving silent
{"偏执多疑 行踪诡秘如影随形"}
[00:31.31]Pull up on ya, I got trouble right behind me
{"突然现身 身后紧随着厄运"}
[00:34.26]Bite the bullet, suit and tie the silver lining
{"忍辱负重 西装革履暗藏转机"}
[00:36.74]I'ma show you how to crash a party
{"让我教你如何搅乱这场宴席"}
[00:39.16]Every time you pop off
{"每当你锋芒毕露"}
[00:40.50]
[00:41.17]They hoping that you fall hard
{"他们便盼你粉身碎骨"}
[00:42.60]
[00:43.12]They praying for the death of a rockstar
{"正为摇滚巨星的陨落祷告"}
[00:45.61]Everybody hating ever since you got more
{"自你飞黄腾达 周遭尽是嫉妒喧嚣"}
[00:48.24]
[00:48.77]They praying for the death of a rockstar
{"正为摇滚巨星的陨落祷告"}
[00:51.08]Oooh they love it when you lost boy
{"他们最爱看你落魄的模样"}
[00:53.91]
